  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FMO intends to fund this investment as part of this strategic effort to reach its own GHG goals while realising an acceptable risk-return level. It has been well documented that investing in (commercial) forestry and forestry related activities contributes significantly - and most efficiently - to the GHG targets. Also, forestry generates more than average (rural) employment than other productive industries.</narrative>
  </description>
